{"title":"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems\">2002 AMC 12A #15</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 10A Problems\">2002 AMC 10A #21</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The mean, median, unique mode, and range of a collection of eight integers are all equal to 8. The largest integer that can be an element of this collection is \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/b/3dbc1285494ac244dcaefe6d3beb466f339dcc19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) }11 \\qquad \\text{(B) }12 \\qquad \\text{(C) }13 \\qquad \\text{(D) }14 \\qquad \\text{(E) }15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"375\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As the unique mode is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, there are at least two <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s.\n</p><p>As the range is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and one of the numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the largest one can be at most <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>If the largest one is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, then the smallest one is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and thus the mean is strictly larger than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, which is a contradiction.\n</p><p>If we have 2 8's we can find the numbers 4, 6, 7, 8, 8, 9, 10, 12.\nThis is a possible solution but has not reached the maximum.\n</p><p>If we have 4 8's we can find the numbers 6, 6, 6, 8, 8, 8, 8, 14.\n</p><p>We can also see that they satisfy the need for the mode, median, and range to be 8. This means that the answer will be\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/3/633e41dd80e3df880bb39bc696a89d119fd27faf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(D)}\\ 14 }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"61\" height=\"28\" />. ~By QWERTYUIOPASDFGHJKLZXCVBNM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We could express this collection as integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/0/b104a7cec6854200c0282dccf53f4311a306a1c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\textsubscript{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/1/ad1c6f33c16d12b510187e59253a3b9a69e6491f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\textsubscript{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/0/b104a7cec6854200c0282dccf53f4311a306a1c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\textsubscript{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> being the smallest and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/1/ad1c6f33c16d12b510187e59253a3b9a69e6491f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\textsubscript{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> being the largest.\n</p><p>Since the mode is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/3/d53909d77d352b88e5a4f4d7034ae5e49dafcb4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\textsubscript{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/a/eeae93118449d53a43022ef1a6ca94a9db21a580.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\textsubscript{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> must also be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. If they were not, the other numbers, which are lesser and greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/3/d53909d77d352b88e5a4f4d7034ae5e49dafcb4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\textsubscript{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/a/eeae93118449d53a43022ef1a6ca94a9db21a580.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\textsubscript{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> respectively, would not be able to satisfy the condition that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is the mode.\n</p><p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> terms and the mean is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. This tells us that the sum of all the numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/e/05e228ac5bee7b9ffb60cacf50f3f2c7c31f8038.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$64$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>We want to maximize the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/1/ad1c6f33c16d12b510187e59253a3b9a69e6491f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\textsubscript{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />, so we set  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/e/0bea182db8605801e31b1adc79bc2012173dc980.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\textsubscript{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/3/79396341648ef156f24614916cf47f8d9e78d365.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\textsubscript{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> as well.\n</p><p>Knowing that we want to minimize numbers and that the range is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> , we set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/0/b104a7cec6854200c0282dccf53f4311a306a1c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\textsubscript{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/5/9957b63459be81449ac74819db2000948ea0a835.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\textsubscript{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/4/b3486021d68eeaccbd4d3f79417a9cf7231cfbd6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\textsubscript{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/5/875e7d1aabb6d910db47867c8d59476346a3ac97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\textsubscript{8} - 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>{<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/0/b104a7cec6854200c0282dccf53f4311a306a1c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\textsubscript{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/5/9957b63459be81449ac74819db2000948ea0a835.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\textsubscript{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/4/b3486021d68eeaccbd4d3f79417a9cf7231cfbd6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\textsubscript{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/3/d53909d77d352b88e5a4f4d7034ae5e49dafcb4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\textsubscript{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/a/eeae93118449d53a43022ef1a6ca94a9db21a580.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\textsubscript{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/e/0bea182db8605801e31b1adc79bc2012173dc980.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\textsubscript{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/3/79396341648ef156f24614916cf47f8d9e78d365.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\textsubscript{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/1/ad1c6f33c16d12b510187e59253a3b9a69e6491f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\textsubscript{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />} <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/e/d5eb8726a34932d28103ce7ce17456421222603f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"9\" /> {<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/5/875e7d1aabb6d910db47867c8d59476346a3ac97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\textsubscript{8} - 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/5/875e7d1aabb6d910db47867c8d59476346a3ac97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\textsubscript{8} - 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/5/875e7d1aabb6d910db47867c8d59476346a3ac97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\textsubscript{8} - 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/1/ad1c6f33c16d12b510187e59253a3b9a69e6491f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\textsubscript{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />}\n</p><p>Letting the sum of all the numbers be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/e/05e228ac5bee7b9ffb60cacf50f3f2c7c31f8038.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$64$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" />, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/c/33c019d396974387dc3fca23a1f717a35b9b610d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32 + 4a_8 - 24 = 64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"151\" height=\"17\" />, which simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/b/7ab69cfbd1a9cb18424d23af8dfc091c16fbdaec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a_8 = 56$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"70\" height=\"17\" />. Solving, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/3/633e41dd80e3df880bb39bc696a89d119fd27faf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(D)}\\ 14 }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"61\" height=\"28\" />. ~By SK80, mod_x and huniiya for minor edits\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let's say that we choose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> numbers to be 8, and the largest number to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />. There will therefore be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/6/7e6b1b9695e194f09e432cbd06ba421b31a8e329.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7-k$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" /> numbers with the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/d/91d341888364121ad59c7fafd3024ab49fed472a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L - 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"46\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>This gives the following expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/1/be1d72890a22479d357995322bb0c491c6811eb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(7-k)(L-8)+ 8k + L}{8} = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"228\" height=\"40\" />. Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/f/1dfa34a11d34c6219c5b2d8fe390a3e603227778.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{120-8L}{16-L} = k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"111\" height=\"41\" />. The bank of choices we have for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> is represented by answer choices (A), (B), (C), (D), and (E).\n</p><p>We find that the value for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/820a20de2847dfdc1bc5cffc8d904933150032bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/4/1b4096f1768d4b1191ccc0386de6b4cc16503a1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> creating the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/1/c41da8754b0e46c49c1f640293b1369dabc8c2ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$666-8888-14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"128\" height=\"15\" />, which satisfies all conditions.\n</p><p>This gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/3/633e41dd80e3df880bb39bc696a89d119fd27faf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(D)}\\ 14 }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"61\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the mean of the numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> numbers, the sum of all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/e/05e228ac5bee7b9ffb60cacf50f3f2c7c31f8038.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$64$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" />. Since the range is also <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, let the smallest value in the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c68940595d96622f3f9c1391c625ed0d86ab4425.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"10\" />. Therefore the largest number in the set is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/5/d65c628d587ec69980d7e7fb74d78da5edbc18a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />. The mode is the number which appears most often, so we can let the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />th to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />th largest integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/2/7f26722d27c51da5fe985e0420525ef4bfee4efa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= 8$\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" />. To maximize the largest value, we will let the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />nd and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />rd smallest integers also equal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>In order this will be: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/a/60a41a19e2cb3cab369535586733e2b9d32927c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x, x, x, 8, 8, 8, 8, x+8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"168\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Now we can set the expression equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/e/05e228ac5bee7b9ffb60cacf50f3f2c7c31f8038.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$64$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" /> (because of what we determined in the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />st step): <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/2/8229874ef1487e87a8572a02f7d53e7c2ebce102.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+x+x+8+8+8+8+x+8=64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"309\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Simplyifying, \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/1/cd1c66a5182c37392cabc265533b8da07097a1a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x+40=64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/d/46d6c9bb168a16e4bb73f2a1483fa7dbe1d03090.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x=24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/9/fd92d02476c3434bf645bf5a3bc249eca83d3c16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is the smallest number in the set, the largest number in the set will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/5/d65c628d587ec69980d7e7fb74d78da5edbc18a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/3/633e41dd80e3df880bb39bc696a89d119fd27faf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(D)}\\ 14 }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"61\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~goofytaipan\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/xqo0PgH-h8Y?t=848\">https://youtu.be/xqo0PgH-h8Y?t=848</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/BNa1Ffu517I\">https://youtu.be/BNa1Ffu517I</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sic_pM_cmrA\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sic_pM_cmrA</a>   ~David\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A\">2002 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br